bun.lock
bun.lockb

# Dependencies and build outputs
**/node_modules/**
**/dist/**
**/dist-spa/**
**/coverage/**
**/playwright-report/**
**/test-results/**
**/.astro/**
**/.repos/**
src-tauri/target/**
src-tauri/gen/**
